      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> three times per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The zomok teleports itself with the effects of a 5th-rank Translocate spell, but the zomok must begin and end the teleportation effect in forest terrain. The zomok regains @Damage[10d10[healing]] Hit Points during this teleportation. Creatures swallowed by the zomok are left behind.</p>\n<p>The zomok can't use Forest Step again for [[/gmr 1d6+1 #rounds]]{1d6+1 rounds}.</p>",
